   "subject": "Re: [r-inla] Re: Categorical Variables.",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>Looks like educationlevel isn&#39;t a factor: check your data with str() and if necessary use factor(), e.g.:<br><br></div>Data$educationlevel &lt;- factor(Data$educationlevel)<br></div>levels(Data$educationlevel) # check hte levels, and see if &quot;Primary&quot; if first. If not...<br><div><br>Data$educationlevel &lt;- factor(Data$educationlevel, levels=c(&quot;Primary&quot;, &quot;secondary&quot;, &quot;Tertiary&quot;))<br><br></div><div>Bob<br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
