     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>Looks like educationlevel isn&#39;t a factor: check your data with str() and if necessary use factor(), e.g.:<br><br></div>Data$educationlevel &lt;- factor(Data$educationlevel)<br></div>levels(Data$educationlevel) # check hte levels, and see if &quot;Primary&quot; if first. If not...<br><div><br>Data$educationlevel &lt;- factor(Data$educationlevel, levels=c(&quot;Primary&quot;, &quot;secondary&quot;, &quot;Tertiary&quot;))<br><br></div><div>Bob<br></div></div></blockquote></div>"
